# Run artifacts are scratch by default — ignore everything.
*
!.gitignore

# Exception: keep the committed slurm-cpu analysis artifacts so results can be
# re-analyzed offline (analyze_throughput.py reads per_rollout_retries.jsonl
# from here). Verbose server/driver logs stay ignored — they are large and not
# analysis data.
!slurm-cpu/
!slurm-cpu/**
slurm-cpu/**/*.log
